                "fallback": "#cmo #marketing #ai #marketing #digitaltransformation #innovation | David Remaud",
                "text": "As #CMO, I recently asked my #marketing team a simple question:\n“Where and how are we actually using AI tools in our day-to-day work?”\n\nThe answers were both inspiring and eye-opening. Here’s a snapshot of the diverse ways our team leverages AI to drive results, boost creativity, and save time across our operations:\n\n:mag: Research &amp; Market Analysis\nUsing: Gemini Deep Search, Perplexity, ChatGPT, Dust\nTeam activities: Analyses, research in Confluence, best-practices benchmarking, inspiration, and concept validation\n\n:writing_hand: Content Creation, Editing &amp; Structuring\nUsing: ChatGPT, Claude, Copilot, Gemini, Grammarly\nTeam activities: Marketing emails, content restructuring, rewording, translations, syntax\/grammar checks, repurposing content, document structuring\n\n:earth_africa: Translation\nUsing: ChatGPT, Claude\nTeam activities: Fast, high-quality translations for campaigns and internal docs\n\n:bulb: Ideation &amp; Inspiration\nUsing: ChatGPT, Claude\nTeam activities: Brainstorming, concept development, creative inspiration\n\n:computer: Coding Support\nUsing: ChatGPT\nTeam activities: Finding coding errors, “how to” guides, Excel support\n\n:frame_with_picture: Image Generation &amp; Editing\nUsing: Midjourney, Grok, Adobe AI, ChatGPT\nTeam activities: Generating visuals, retouching images, creating illustrations\n\n:movie_camera: Video &amp; Audio Creation\nUsing: Heygen, HappyScribe, Descript\nTeam activities: Avatar videos, audio\/video transcription\n\n:memo: Meeting Minutes &amp; Notes\nUsing: Copilot, <http:\/\/PLAUD.AI|PLAUD.AI>\nTeam activities: Automated Teams meeting notes, physical meeting summaries\n\n:chart_with_upwards_trend: Sales &amp; Prospecting\nUsing: <http:\/\/Ocean.io|Ocean.io>, Modjo\nTeam activities: Prospecting, sales insights\n\nCurious to hear from other marketers:\n\nHow are you using AI in your daily workflow? Any surprises or favorite tools?\n#AI #Marketing #DigitalTransformation #Innovation",
